{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/463676-question-on-creating-the-pure","id":463676,"title":"Question on creating the Pure","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-03-31T11:48:47-07:00","id":463676,"title":"Question on creating the Pure","content":"Okay, maybe I missed it in the book somewhere, but I haven't seen a step-by-step guide to making &quot;The Pure&quot; characters/NPC's. My main question is on the &quot;Tribe&quot; of these Uratha. Particularly, to define what Gifts and Renown they have access too. Do I simply make a Forsaken, and then convert it to a &quot;Pure&quot; werewolf, thus using those listed for their previous Tribe? I appreciate any assistance or guidance in this matter. Thank you in advance!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5529-waroth","name":"Waroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5529_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-31T11:53:19-07:00","id":463698,"title":"","content":"There's not really a lot of guidance. They don't have Auspices (meaning they definitely don't have access to any of the Moon Gifts), but they did at one point, so you could pick from the Auspice Shadow Gift lists. Tribe-wise, there's nothing given for the Pure though.I pick based on what makes sense for the character concept, and sometimes based on the totem. If a gift makes sense for their Pack totem, I give it to them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=484226#post484226\" target=\"_blank\">Nihhina kalekal-zidu kal masun, kal manudanadu. Nihhina kalekal-zidu nukal shaghu-desasudu \u2014 nihhina kalekal-zidu kal innu-desasudu udhkal samm</a>.&quot; Arthur Ashe<br /> She/her, contributing writer for <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/363404/Scion-Pride-2021\" target=\"_blank\">Scion: Pride 2021</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1923-bigdamnhero","name":"BigDamnHero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1923_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1263"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-31T12:04:44-07:00","id":463708,"title":"","content":"In first edition every pure tribe treated purity and one other renown as in-tribe. For Fire-Touched this was wisdom, for Ivory Claws it was Honour and for Predator kings it was Glory. This might have changed in 2e but until anything comes out that will probably work well enough, <br /> <br /> Likewise each tribe is associated with four gift lists. Fire Touched get Insight and Inspiration as well as two others called Disease and Fevor, which don't currently have a 2e version. Ivory Claws get Dominance and Warding plus ones called Agony and Scourging (no 2e version of those yet either), and Predator kings get Nature, Rage and Strength plus a gift called Savagery (same). <br /> <br /> Aside from that the process is pretty much the same as with a forsaken. Hope this helps.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-31T13:21:17-07:00","id":463806,"title":"","content":"Thank you both for helping me solve this issue.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5529-waroth","name":"Waroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5529_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}